997
01:02:51,400 --> 01:02:54,880
Because this thing
is with zero torque.

998
01:02:54,880 --> 01:02:58,550
It's passive in the swing phase.

999
01:02:58,550 --> 01:03:00,790
So I can just drive
myself up to the place

1000
01:03:00,790 --> 01:03:05,380
