1002
01:03:07,510 --> 01:03:08,710
And that worked locally.

1003
01:03:08,710 --> 01:03:09,510
That's a good idea.

1004
01:03:16,050 --> 01:03:18,680
There's another
bunch of work that's

1005
01:03:18,680 --> 01:03:21,720
